# Catálogo de errores (ESPECIFICACION.md §6). Cada Case es un documento que debe fallar con
# ese código en esa línea, que cuenta desde la primera línea del documento. Lo comprueba
# ErrorCatalogTest, con las fuentes de resources/fonts. Los códigos son los de ErrorCode,
# salvo los de sintaxis STXT y del schema, que son de stxt-core (INVALID_VALUE, CHILD_NOT_DECLARED…).
# Al añadir un caso, cuenta la línea a mano.
Errors:
	Case: Raíz sin namespace
		Code: DOCUMENT_ROOT
		Line: 1
		Document >>
			Document:
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Block:
					Box:
						Height: 10
	Case: Raíz que no es Document
		Code: DOCUMENT_ROOT
		Line: 1
		Document >>
			Block (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Id: a
	Case: Valor fuera del ENUM del schema
		Code: INVALID_VALUE
		Line: 7
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Block:
					Typography:
						Align: middle
	Case: Paginado sin alto
		Code: MEDIA_HEIGHT_REQUIRED
		Line: 2
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: paged
					Width: 595
				Block:
					Box:
						Height: 10
	Case: Alto del medio en continuo
		Code: MEDIA_HEIGHT_CONTINUOUS
		Line: 5
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
					Height: 842
				Block:
					Box:
						Height: 10
	Case: Márgenes del medio sin área útil
		Code: MEDIA_SIZE
		Line: 5
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
					Margin: 300
				Block:
					Box:
						Height: 10
	Case: Coma decimal
		Code: VALUE_SYNTAX
		Line: 7
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Block:
					Box:
						Width: 12,5
	Case: Fracción fuera de grid
		Code: VALUE_NOT_ALLOWED
		Line: 7
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Block:
					Box:
						Width: 1fr
	Case: Alto negativo
		Code: VALUE_NOT_ALLOWED
		Line: 7
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Block:
					Box:
						Height: -10
	Case: Intrínseco en Max width
		Code: VALUE_NOT_ALLOWED
		Line: 7
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Block:
					Box:
						Max width: max-content
	Case: Hueco con auto
		Code: VALUE_NOT_ALLOWED
		Line: 6
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Flex:
					Gap: auto
	Case: fit-content como pista
		Code: FIT_CONTENT_TRACK
		Line: 6
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Grid:
					Columns: fit-content 1fr
	Case: Id repetido
		Code: DUPLICATE_ID
		Line: 10
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Block:
					Id: a
					Box:
						Height: 10
				Block:
					Id: a
					Box:
						Height: 10
	Case: Elemento dentro de Text
		Code: CHILD_NOT_DECLARED
		Line: 6
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Text: hola
					Block:
						Box:
							Height: 10
	Case: Cell con dos elementos
		Code: SINGLE_ELEMENT
		Line: 10
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Grid:
					Cell:
						Block:
							Box:
								Height: 10
						Text: hola
	Case: Item sin elemento
		Code: SINGLE_ELEMENT
		Line: 6
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Flex:
					Item:
						Grow: 1
	Case: Text con el texto en el valor y en Content
		Code: TEXT_CONTENT
		Line: 6
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Text: hola
					Content >>
						adiós
	Case: Text sin texto
		Code: TEXT_CONTENT
		Line: 5
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Text:
					Box:
						Height: 10
	Case: Texto sin Font
		Code: TEXT_WITHOUT_FONT
		Line: 5
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Text: hola
					Typography:
						Size: 12
	Case: Texto sin Size
		Code: TEXT_WITHOUT_FONT_SIZE
		Line: 7
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Typography:
					Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Text: hola
	Case: Texto de un ítem sin Font
		Code: TEXT_WITHOUT_FONT
		Line: 7
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Flex:
					Item:
						Text: hola
	Case: Text como bloque (el bloque va en Content)
		Code: BLOCK_FORM_NOT_ALLOWED
		Line: 5
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Text >>
					Primer párrafo.
	Case: Propiedad de grid en un Flex
		Code: CHILD_NOT_DECLARED
		Line: 6
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Flex:
					Columns: 1fr 1fr
	Case: Grow en una celda de grid
		Code: CHILD_NOT_DECLARED
		Line: 7
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Grid:
					Cell:
						Grow: 1
						Block:
							Box:
								Height: 10
	Case: Cell en un Flex
		Code: CHILD_NOT_DECLARED
		Line: 6
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Flex:
					Cell: 1 1
						Block:
							Box:
								Height: 10
	Case: Offset en un Block
		Code: CHILD_NOT_DECLARED
		Line: 8
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Block:
					Box:
						Height: 10
					Offset: 10
	Case: Relative desde arriba y abajo
		Code: OFFSET_CONFLICT
		Line: 6
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Relative:
					Offset: 5 auto 9 auto
					Box:
						Height: 10
	Case: Relative desde izquierda y derecha
		Code: OFFSET_CONFLICT
		Line: 6
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Relative:
					Offset: auto 7 auto 11
					Box:
						Height: 10
	Case: Absolute sobre-restringida
		Code: OVERCONSTRAINED
		Line: 6
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Absolute:
					Offset: 0 10 auto 10
					Box:
						Width: 100
						Height: 10
	Case: Margin auto en un ítem de flex
		Code: MARGIN_AUTO_WITHOUT_EFFECT
		Line: 11
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Flex:
					Item:
						Block:
							Box:
								Width: 100
								Height: 10
								Margin: 0 auto
	Case: Margin auto vertical en bloque
		Code: MARGIN_AUTO_WITHOUT_EFFECT
		Line: 8
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Block:
					Box:
						Height: 10
						Margin: auto 0
	Case: Margin auto sin ancho limitado
		Code: MARGIN_AUTO_WITHOUT_EFFECT
		Line: 8
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Block:
					Box:
						Height: 10
						Margin: 0 auto
	Case: Margin auto en absolute sin inicio y fin
		Code: MARGIN_AUTO_WITHOUT_EFFECT
		Line: 9
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Absolute:
					Box:
						Width: 100
						Height: 10
						Margin: 0 auto
	Case: Layer en un Block
		Code: CHILD_NOT_DECLARED
		Line: 8
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Block:
					Box:
						Height: 10
					Layer: 2
	Case: Lines sin Wrap
		Code: LINES_WITHOUT_WRAP
		Line: 6
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Flex:
					Lines: center
	Case: Grow en column sin alto
		Code: GROW_WITHOUT_EFFECT
		Line: 8
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Flex:
					Direction: column
					Item:
						Grow: 1
						Block:
	Case: Aspect ratio con Width y Height
		Code: ASPECT_RATIO_CONFLICT
		Line: 9
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Block:
					Box:
						Width: 100
						Height: 50
						Aspect ratio: 16/9
	Case: Mínimo mayor que el máximo
		Code: MIN_MAX_CONFLICT
		Line: 9
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Block:
					Box:
						Height: 10
						Max width: 100
						Min width: 150
	Case: Ancho mayor que el máximo
		Code: MIN_MAX_CONFLICT
		Line: 7
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Block:
					Box:
						Width: 60%
						Max width: 50%
						Height: 10
	Case: Porcentaje de alto en continuo
		Code: INDEFINITE_PERCENTAGE
		Line: 7
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Block:
					Box:
						Height: 50%
	Case: Porcentaje de alto con el padre en auto
		Code: INDEFINITE_PERCENTAGE
		Line: 9
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: paged
					Width: 595
					Height: 842
				Block:
					Block:
						Box:
							Min height: min(20, 10%)
	Case: Desplazamiento vertical en porcentaje
		Code: INDEFINITE_PERCENTAGE
		Line: 6
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Relative:
					Offset: 10% auto auto auto
					Box:
						Height: 10
	Case: Filas en porcentaje sin alto
		Code: INDEFINITE_PERCENTAGE
		Line: 6
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Grid:
					Rows: 50% 50%
	Case: Basis en porcentaje en column sin alto
		Code: INDEFINITE_PERCENTAGE
		Line: 8
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Flex:
					Direction: column
					Item:
						Basis: 50%
						Block:
	Case: Hueco entre filas en porcentaje sin alto
		Code: INDEFINITE_PERCENTAGE
		Line: 6
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Grid:
					Gap: 5% 10
	Case: Cortes en un Absolute
		Code: CHILD_NOT_DECLARED
		Line: 9
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: paged
					Width: 595
					Height: 842
				Absolute:
					Box:
						Height: 10
					Break:
						Before: page
	Case: Áreas no rectangulares
		Code: GRID_PLACEMENT
		Line: 6
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Grid:
					Areas >>
						a a
						a b
						b b
	Case: Área desconocida en Cell
		Code: GRID_PLACEMENT
		Line: 7
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Grid:
					Areas: a b
					Cell: c
						Block:
							Box:
								Height: 10
	Case: Fuente desconocida, declarada en Document
		Code: FONT_UNKNOWN
		Line: 6
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Typography:
					Font: Helvetica
					Size: 10
				Block:
					Text: hola
	Case: Carácter que la fuente no tiene
		Code: GLYPH_MISSING
		Line: 12
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Typography:
					Font: IBM Plex Sans
					Size: 10
				Text:
					Content >>
						Primera línea

						Kanji 漢
	Case: Palabra más ancha que su línea
		Code: TEXT_OVERFLOW
		Line: 13
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Typography:
					Font: IBM Plex Sans
					Size: 10
				Text:
					Box:
						Width: 100
					Content >>
						Una palabra muy
						supercalifragilisticoespialidosa
	Case: Caja más ancha que el área útil
		Code: BOX_OVERFLOW
		Line: 7
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Block:
					Box:
						Width: 600
						Height: 10
	Case: Hija más ancha que su contenedor
		Code: BOX_OVERFLOW
		Line: 10
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Block:
					Box:
						Width: 100
					Block:
						Box:
							Width: 150
							Height: 10
	Case: Columnas que no caben en el grid
		Code: BOX_OVERFLOW
		Line: 13
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Typography:
					Font: IBM Plex Sans
					Size: 10
				Grid:
					Box:
						Width: 200
					Columns: 1fr 1fr
					Cell: 1 1 1 2
						Text: aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
	Case: Texto más alto que su Height
		Code: BOX_OVERFLOW
		Line: 11
		Document >>
			Document (dev.stxt.boxes):
				Media:
					Type: continuous
					Width: 595
				Typography:
